{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"shioli-kutsuna","name":"Shioli Kutsuna","birthDate":"1992-12-22","birthPlace":"Killarney Heights, Sydney, New South Wales, Australia","bio":"Shioli Kutsuna (Japanese: 忽那 汐里, Hepburn: Kutsuna Shiori, born 22 December 1992) is a Japanese-Australian actress known for her role as Ran Mori in Shinichi Kudo's Written Challenge!, Minami Maho in Beck (2010), Haru/Harumi in 125 Years Memory (2015), and Yukio in Deadpool 2 (2018) and Deadpool & Wolverine (2024). She plays Mitsuki in the Apple TV+ series Invasion (2021). In 2014, she won the Japan Academy Film Prize for Newcomer of the Year.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Shioli Kutsuna, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:56:26+00:00","tmdbId":230660,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/230660","credits":[{"id":"deadpool-wolverine","title":"Deadpool & Wolverine","character":"Yukio"},{"id":"deadpool-2","title":"Deadpool 2","character":"Yukio"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/shioli-kutsuna.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Her Private Hell","year":2026,"character":"Ms. T","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aD2z0Q6OXOibLDZTYG13joyKd4a.jpg"},{"name":"Eugene the Marine","year":2025,"character":"Parker","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fC1Fs6ptzSbxwP6ZvOOWHLNJIZc.jpg"},{"name":"Deadpool & Wolverine","year":2024,"character":"Yukio","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8cdWjvZQUExUUTzyp4t6EDMubfO.jpg"},{"name":"Sanctuary","year":2023,"character":"Asuka Kunishima","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fnr87DcGxKB02vcuZlLgxX8tHPs.jpg"},{"name":"Invasion","year":2021,"character":"Mitsuki Yamato","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1PdNB3rYTcf8VXc8rcmZ0SeYxSq.jpg"},{"name":"Murder Mystery","year":2019,"character":"Suzy Nakamura","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w